(
    title: "Lady in Wading",
    description: Some("A lady builds a bridge across a castle moat plank by plank, jumping the crocodile that surfaces to grab her and the little monster that gives chase once the bridge is part built — and, on the harder setting, a flying dragon dropping fireballs. With the bridge finished she climbs the tower to the captive prince. Turns are unlimited: the clock is what you play against."),
